Date: Tue, 03 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 23/23] FreeChat: create channels

Creating a room offers "Channel": its power levels let only moderators
and admins post, while everyone can still react. Members get the usual
"no permission to post" composer.
